/client.ts
Purpose: Thin fetch wrappers for mud-builder-server (capabilities, areas incl. baseHash/conditional save, reload, world incl. Phase 12b limitPressure, skills/groups incl. Phase 12 baseHash conditional overlay saves, Phase 9 auth key management, Phase 10 import preview/commit + audit tail, Phase 11 presence/presenceBeat + ExternalRef/PresenceEntry types, Phase 12 areaMap/worldMap + map response types now carrying exit locks + room warps, Phase 13 spawn(file) → SimulateResetsResult imported straight from @shatteredarchive/merc-area, not duplicated locally, Phase 14a codegenSpells/saveCodegenSpells (baseHash-conditional) + codegenPatch via a requestText helper because the patch route answers text/plain and the JSON-only request<T> would silently mangle it) — attaches the stored builder token (localStorage 'mb-token') as a Bearer header on every request; errors throw ApiError with status, 401s hint at the Access tab.
